{"counts":{"canonical":17,"context":0,"total":17,"unknown_date":0,"unlinked":0},"events":[{"aliases":["Archaeological Site of Mehrgarh","泥砖","聚落"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-bf2f7311a77f802426eb3684","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5772d60dd6f8b81bb35ec734","summary":"梅赫尔格尔位于今巴基斯坦俾路支省的卡奇平原，靠近博兰山口和博兰河。这里保存了跨公元前第七至第三千纪的长期考古序列，地层深逾十一米。多代居民反复营建泥砖建筑，旧屋遗存被新建筑覆盖，逐渐累积成今天看到的聚落土丘。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第七至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-7000},"title":"梅赫尔格尔群体连续营建泥砖聚落"},{"aliases":["Early Plains Archaic","食物","环境适应"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["北美大平原"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4070732f6deb2a7d3d2c2708","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-8f147befdcb86f09bb7979b3","summary":"约公元前5600至前3000年，北美大平原早期古风时期的人群仍大量依赖野牛，同时更常利用鱼类、鸟类和浆果。当地生计并非始终不变：早期猎人已经发展出步行协作驱赶猎物及使用投射工具的办法，河谷和草原的不同资源也共同进入食物来源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5600年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5600},"title":"北美大平原早期古风时期的食物利用"},{"aliases":["Chinchorro","丧葬","遗体处理"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["钦乔罗文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-6abcf6ce3331b30f63ffec6d","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-5497db2bba26e3b36f16fc2b","summary":"钦乔罗文化的海洋狩猎采集群体，约在公元前5450至前890年生活于今智利北部干旱的阿塔卡马沿海。海洋资源是其生计的重要基础，遗址中发现用骨、贝壳以及矿物和植物材料制作的工具，也保存了格外复杂的葬俗证据。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5450—前890年","end_year":-890,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5450},"title":"钦乔罗海洋采集群体发展人工木乃伊葬俗"},{"aliases":["Kitakogane Site","渔业","贝丘","居住"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-4ef0cd76f93ea5148e1ddd8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ed76ae8247c548adbfb267a6","summary":"北黄金遗址位于北海道西南部内浦湾东岸的台地，考古范围约从公元前5000年延续至前2000年。聚落包含竖穴住居、墓葬、贝丘和用水地点。大量贝壳、鱼骨与海兽骨表明，当地居民充分利用沿海水域，以捕鱼和其他海洋资源获取为重要生计。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前2000年","end_year":-2000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"北黄金居民以渔业为重要生计并营建聚落"},{"aliases":["人面鱼纹彩陶盆","彩陶","图像"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f2285c47e34d4ce2713c9acb","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f2285c47e34d4ce2713c9acb","record_type":"work","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-ac86e5c4cd7aa0d4b198e69e","summary":"半坡人面鱼纹彩陶盆以红色陶胎和黑彩构成鲜明对比：盆内壁绘有两组相对的人面鱼纹，鱼的头部和人嘴轮廓彼此结合，另有鱼纹穿插其间。人物的眼、鼻及头部装饰被简化为明确的线条，使自然形象转化成带有想象力的装饰构图。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-5000},"title":"半坡人面鱼纹彩陶盆"},{"aliases":["transitional period","农业","城市起源"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["印度河文明"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-acead5667bb162fd5c75046c","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-cdef436efdb8ba9b018a1331","summary":"约公元前5000至前2600年，印度河地区的一些农业聚落逐渐扩大，呈现从村落迈向城镇的变化。考古发现中，住宅和道路的布局更为清楚，聚落也常靠近适于耕作的土地或便利交换的地点。相似器物在较大区域内出现，反映不同社区之间的联系不断增多。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前2600年","end_year":-2600,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"印度河地区迈向城市文明"},{"aliases":["Prehistoric Pile Dwellings around the Alps","居住建筑","环境利用"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-a536f3f65d5c123aab2dee06","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-843c3d0b25516b22aa225af7","summary":"约公元前5000至前500年，阿尔卑斯及周边人群在湖岸、河边和湿地附近营建桩上聚落。列入世界遗产的系列包含多个国家的一百余处遗址，记录了新石器时代至青铜时代不同群体的居住方式。它们不是一座持续存在的城市，而是一组跨越漫长时期的聚落材料。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000—前500年","end_year":-500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"阿尔卑斯周边群体营建水边桩上聚落"},{"aliases":["Yangshao (painted pottery) culture","考古","制陶"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["黄河流域新石器文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-9cbeae08566b87e98af368ec","images":[],"map_reference":{"checked_at":"2026-10-25","kind":"region_reference","label":"黄河","latitude":36.12419444444444,"license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","longitude":116.09766666666667,"note":"本条所引原文明确涉及黄河；地图采用资料支持的地点范围，不表示精确场址或完整路线。 地理补录不代表整条史实已经终审。","precision":"region","role":"材料涉及地点","source_title":"Wikidata Q7355 · P625","source_url":"https://www.wikidata.org/w/index.php?title=Q7355&oldid=2541774085"},"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9cbeae08566b87e98af368ec","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3db213eb11777bf0eb2fa84d","summary":"约公元前5000至前3000年，黄河中游分布着以彩陶和村落遗存著称的仰韶文化。考古学家通过陶器形制、纹饰以及房屋、墓葬的组合辨认不同遗址的联系。大量粟作村落、石制工具和制作精细的陶器，显示当地人群已经形成较稳定的农业生活。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前5000年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-5000},"title":"黄河中游的仰韶文化"},{"aliases":["来源未给独立事件专名；据所列遗址、器物或行动描述拟题。","农业","稻粟交流"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-87fc4996d743bab8e1320fad","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-87fc4996d743bab8e1320fad","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-02d7d0b65ba6e8437e7207e6","summary":"城头山的大溪文化遗存中，除稻之外还发现了粟，所引综述列出的遗址范围约为公元前4400至前3300年。这些小型植物遗存提示，长江中游居民的作物选择并非只有水稻，通常同北方旱作联系的谷物，也已经进入南方的食物与生产体系。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4400—前3300年","end_year":-3300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-4400},"title":"城头山的粟遗存"},{"aliases":["Neolithic Flint Mines of Spiennes","采矿","燧石"],"body":[],"categories":["科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-3018b66a9fc5ba7f72da3494","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-3018b66a9fc5ba7f72da3494","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4e1b20bbc314b8c6922d89c2","summary":"斯皮耶纳位于今比利时蒙斯附近，约从公元前第五千纪后段至第三千纪上半叶形成密集的地下燧石开采活动。新石器时代矿工通过竖井下到地层，再沿地下巷道接近石料。部分竖井深达十六米，反映他们已经能够针对不同石层安排复杂的取材办法。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前第五千纪末三分之一至第三千纪上半叶","end_year":-2501,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4333},"title":"斯皮耶纳群体开采地下燧石矿"},{"aliases":["Norte Chico","灌溉","农业"],"body":[],"categories":["科技","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["安第斯北奇科地区"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-9f5890c5322f6aac42561e18","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[{"coordinates":null,"label":"Norte Chico","precision":"named_place","role":"source_mentioned_place"}],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-9f5890c5322f6aac42561e18","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-1b17a84b18a7f3571edb9d8a","summary":"安第斯沿海腹地约公元前4000至前3000年的修渠活动，被所引教材放在海岸与内陆社区交换的背景中讨论。沿海遗址既留有棉制渔网，也出现来自内陆的产品，说明不同生态区的人群之间存在物品往来；水渠可能是这种关系中的一项共同工程。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000年—公元前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"安第斯沿海腹地修建水渠"},{"aliases":["Naqada culture","彩陶"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["前王朝埃及"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-fcdc55e0fb80c372534bf829","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-fcdc55e0fb80c372534bf829","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-4f283875d83e50da67d159f3","summary":"涅伽达文化陶器留下了埃及王朝形成前丰富的装饰材料。这类文化遗存中，可见碗、瓶、罐等不同器形，表面绘有波浪、植物和人物等图案。这些纹样使陶器既具有储存等生活用途，也成为观察当时形象表达的重要载体。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000—前3000年","end_year":-3000,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"涅伽达文化陶器绘制波浪与人物纹样"},{"aliases":["Valdivia ceramic figurines","陶塑","制陶"],"body":[],"categories":["艺术","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["瓦尔迪维亚文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-99ea96dc70a6fa41196cd344","images":[{"caption":"瓦尔迪维亚陶塑，约公元前2200—前2000年，晚于本文所述制作传统的起始阶段；大都会艺术博物馆藏1980.83.12。","creator":"摄影者未单列；馆藏影像提供：The Metropolitan Museum of Art","credit":"The Metropolitan Museum of Art；Gift of Timothy, Peter, and Jonathan Zorach, 1980；CC0 1.0","depiction_type":"museum_object_photograph","license":"CC0 1.0","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/","obligations":[],"rights_revision_url":null,"sha256":"7dbab8fe83a6252549e4fe5f815f224afe727a015b243a0b2d13ac9d5c00e033","source_url":"https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/314201","src":"/api/history/assets/AS-7dbab8fe83a6252549e4fe5f815f224afe727a015b243a0b2d13ac9d5c00e033.jpg"}],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-99ea96dc70a6fa41196cd344","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-c611496947795443ef02cdc0","summary":"约公元前4000至前3500年，厄瓜多尔沿海瓦尔迪维亚一些遗址开始制作陶塑人物，延续了当地较早的石质人物造型传统。馆方介绍，这类陶塑常以两条泥条挤压结合，再塑出躯干和其他部位，使人体成为可以握持、保存的小型形象。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000—前3500年","end_year":-3500,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"year_range","start_year":-4000},"title":"瓦尔迪维亚群体制作陶塑人物"},{"aliases":["Megalithic Temples of Malta","巨石建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-7c00599f2172bee57df0df8f","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-3c2e3ca3b2fa74f46abc623c","summary":"公元前第四至第三千纪，马耳他及戈佐岛的建造者用本地石材营建巨石庙。建筑常由立起的石板、上部横石、铺地庭院及沿中轴两侧展开的半圆形房间组成，各处平面与构造又有所不同。这些遗存表明，建造者能够根据石材性质和空间需求安排大型结构。","time":{"approximate":false,"display":"公元前第四至第三千纪","end_year":-2001,"kind":"dating_range","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他建造者以本地石材营建巨石庙"},{"aliases":["Ħal Saflieni Hypogeum","丧葬","地下建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["宗教","文化"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-2e3ec6f1aabad8fb48945046","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-2e3ec6f1aabad8fb48945046","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-d5868ee503eb91df232a75c6","summary":"哈尔萨夫列尼地下墓地位于今马耳他保拉，约从公元前4000至前2500年持续使用。人们使用燧石、黑曜石等石质工具和鹿角，在较软的石灰岩中凿出上下叠置的三层洞室。最早的上层由山坡开入，之后更多侧室和下层空间逐渐加入。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前4000—前2500年","end_year":-2500,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-4000},"title":"马耳他群体使用哈尔萨夫列尼地下墓地"},{"aliases":["Sannai Maruyama Site","聚落规划","居住建筑"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","科技"],"citations":[],"civilizations":["绳纹文化"],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"world","id":"EV-72d9bdfeb2425fd15adcdd63","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-72d9bdfeb2425fd15adcdd63","record_type":"period","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-25dfe157a9b45cbe1e66db48","summary":"三内丸山遗址位于今日本青森，约公元前3900至前2200年的材料呈现一处大型绳文聚落。竖穴住居、柱支建筑、成列墓葬、储藏坑、道路和人工土丘具有一定规划关系。大量陶器、石器，以及栗、核桃和鱼兽骨骼，显示居民利用河口、内湾和森林的多种资源。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3900—前2200年","end_year":-2200,"kind":"duration","precision":"period","start_year":-3900},"title":"三内丸山居民按规划布置大型聚落"},{"aliases":["凌家滩遗址","聚落","墓葬","玉器"],"body":[],"categories":["文化","宗教","艺术"],"citations":[],"civilizations":[],"content_notice":null,"content_status":"source_backed_draft","entry_kind":"canonical","history_scope":"china","id":"EV-f019fca4c37d699b32a6b173","images":[],"map_reference":null,"notes":[],"people":[],"places":[],"polities":[],"record_id":"REC-f019fca4c37d699b32a6b173","record_type":"site","relations":[],"review_status":"pending","revision_id":"REV-1e0ac2e6e6f4942e7a3993ee","summary":"凌家滩位于安徽含山裕溪河中段，约公元前3800至前3300年的遗存呈现一处大型新石器时代聚落。遗址中发现人工祭坛、大型墓地、祭祀坑、红烧土和积石圈，还出有玉礼器、石器与陶器。建筑、埋葬和器物的组合，为讨论居民的公共及精神生活提供了线索。","time":{"approximate":true,"display":"约公元前3800—前3300年","end_year":-3300,"kind":"duration","precision":"year_range","start_year":-3800},"title":"凌家滩聚落的祭坛与墓地"}],"revision":"21b67d3c98a7c70b1c04875f08dca3b74dd0cbcb50a3001b1f8a5a9a7a572549","schema_version":"1.0.0","scope":"public_database","sources":[],"time_bounds":{"max_year":2026,"min_year":-10000}}